{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["לאשמת העם — the Sages derash: the anointed priest is like the community in the matter of Hora'ot. But by the plain sense: it implies, since concerning priests it is stated: ״יורו משפטיך ליעקב ותורתך לישראל״ — all the more so the High Priest, who is an expert for the many. If the anointed priest sins, in his ruling he also causes the people to sin with him, והקריב על חטאתו וגו׳."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The phrase 'בהוריות' refers to the Sages' comparison of the anointed priest's sin-offering to that of the community in cases of erroneous rulings (Hora'ot)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:15.050001478Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}